ween two NPs. We measured the dependence of the fluorescence enhancement on NP size and number and compare it to numerical simulations. --------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVolume 30 Issue 1 | Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology B | AIP Publishing (https://pubs.aip.org/avs/jvb/issue/30/1)\nciteturn34search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; B 30, 010606 (2012) https://doi.org/10.1116/1.3672010 ... B 30, 011806 (2012) https://doi.org/10.1116/1.3676054\n\n### Roughness optimization of electron-beam exposed hydrogen silsesquioxane for immobilization of DNA origami\n\nFaisal A. Shah; Kyoung Nan Kim; Marya Lieberman; Gary H. Bernstein\n\nJ. Vac. Sci. Technol. B 30, 011806 (2012) https://doi.org/10.1116/1.3676054\n\nAbstract\n\nView articletitled, Roughness optimization of electron-beam exposed hydrogen silsesquioxane for immobilization of DNA origami\n\nOpen the PDF for Roughness optimization of electron-beam exposed hydrogen silsesquioxane for immobilization of DNA origami in another window\n\n### Crystallization of Ge in SiO_{2} matrix by femtosecond laser processing\n\nOmer Salihoglu; Ulaş Kürüm; Halime Gul Yaglioglu; Ayhan Elmali; Atilla Aydinli\n\nJ. Vac. Sci. Technol. B 30, 011807 (2012) https://doi.org/10.1116/1.3677829\n\nAbstract\n\nView articletitled, Crystallization of Ge in SiO<sub>2</sub> matrix by femtosecond laser processing\n\nOpen the PDF for Crystallization of Ge in SiO<sub>2</sub> matrix by femtosecond laser processing in another window\n\n## MEMS & NEMS\n\n### Design and fabrication of GaN crystal ultra-small lateral comb-drive actuators\n\nTakuma Tanae; Hidehisa Sameshima; Kazuhiro Hane\n\nJ. Vac. Sci. Technol. B 30, 012001 (2012) https://doi.org/10.1116/1.3668114\n\nAbstract\n\nView articletitled, Design and fabrication of GaN crystal ultra-small lateral comb-drive actuators\n\nOpen the PDF for Design and fabrication of GaN crystal ultra-small lateral comb-drive actuators in another window\n\n## M